  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Give it a list of gene symbols, by uploading a file or typing them, and it plots their expression across nine spermatogenesis stages (SSC to Sperm) as a per-gene line plot, a summary-statistics plot and a row-clustered heatmap, with an optional z-score per gene. Data used in the run: synthetic. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
